eipzig/Halle airport while practicing for a driving test. Meanwhile, German Chancellor Friedrich Merz announced an industrial AI partnership with Nvidia. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>The homeless man living in front of a London mega-mansion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:12c8e34596b15c09c1d73ecac977d1ad95be5c2ac80b7359bd11dafc0856ec50</id><updated>2026-10-25T04:57:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T10:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-homeless-man-living-in-front-of-a-london-mega-mansion/a-79400925--903398310f06.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-homeless-man-living-in-front-of-a-london-mega-mansion/a-79400925?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Anders Fernstedt lives in London without any money. The Swedish native has built a most unusual home under the porch of a house worth over €200 million. How did that happen?</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>What Earth's sixth mass extinction event means for humans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eef0d1820970710bf67683097c77cc317407537577df48e3fabaf2159964242b</id><updated>2026-10-25T04:57:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T05:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-earth-s-sixth-mass-extinction-event-means-for-humans/a-79680410--0a12d110aea4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-earth-s-sixth-mass-extinction-event-means-for-humans/a-79680410?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Human activity is driving plants and animals to extinction at an unprecedented rate. As countries meet in Armenia to discuss ways to reverse nature loss, DW reveals how declining biodiversity is already harming people.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>France: Young voters blase about Glucksmann's Socialists</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bab67529d309c6b59c767a800b03b287bf5fb620af